      "title": "README",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Abyss whale - bass reactive\n\nStart frame `SolAttn_H3_00005.png`, track `Voltage Bow (Heavier 808 Bass)`.\n\n**Whale is centre-frame, so the reaction is radial from centre.** The 808 drives a growing disc, so H3 re-generates *outward from the whale* instead of uniformly - that is the 'activity coming off it'.\n\nMeasured on this track's first 124 frames: bass mean 0.354, 26 frames over 0.5, 3 over 0.8. The hits are discrete, so the gates below are set low (0.06) and the ring-out carries them."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
