      "title": "Beat brain",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Beat brain\n\n`beat_locations` gives discrete downbeats, not a loudness wobble. `PeakDetector` isolates the 808 hits; `Smoothing` (exponential, alpha 0.40) gives each a ~2-3 frame ring-out so the bioluminescence *swells and falls* rather than strobing on one frame.\n\n`rms_energy` runs in parallel, heavily gaussian-smoothed, as the section-level macro.\n\nWatch both `PreviewFeature` plots before a long render."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
