      "title": "Radial reaction",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Radial reaction - outward from the whale\n\n`H3 Audio Analyze` -> **bass** band -> `Audio Curve To Mask` in `radial` mode. The disc is centred, which is where the whale is, so each 808 pushes a growing circle of regeneration outward from it.\n\n`floor 0.10` keeps a little constant drift in the plankton between hits; `gamma 2.2` keeps the swell on the hits themselves.\n\n`H3 Latent Noise Mask` writes this at the latent's exact shape and aggregates per latent frame (1,4,4,4,4 frames per 5 tokens), so a one-frame 808 is not interpolated away. `audio_mode: preserve` carries the track through untouched."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
