      "title": "Material layer",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Bioluminescent flare\n\nBloom bound to the beat envelope's `intensity` - the light channels on the whale swell on each 808. `threshold 0.55` keeps it on the bright bioluminescence and off the dark water.\n\nChromatic aberration is deliberately tiny (0.003) - enough to feel a pressure kick, not enough to read as a broken video.\n\nGlitch is gated at 0.68 so only the 3 hardest hits in this window touch it. No kaleidoscope: it would destroy the whale's silhouette."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
